WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue { background-color: rgba(247,241,227,0.92); color:#28241E; font-family:"Lexend","Atkinson Hyperlegible",sans-serif; line-height:1.4; font-size:140%; font-weight:600; }

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.600
In Nibras, you can change the colours of every page.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.500
You change them from the icon at the top of the page.

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.690
You can choose from the following colours.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.750
Pick what feels easy on your eyes.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:13.770
The whole page changes with you.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:15.310
To go back to the original, choose No colour.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:19.120
Your choice is saved on your device.
